Why AGPL-3.0?

The AGPL license ensures that:
1. The software remains free and open source
2. Any modifications must be shared with the community
3. Companies cannot take the code private
4. Network use counts as distribution (must share modifications)
5. Derivative works must use the same license

This protects the software from being exploited by commercial entities
while keeping it freely available for personal and educational use.
